"Hire with absolute confidence thanks to a flat placement fee backed by a 12-month free replacement guarantee.","_cards_3_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"built-for-control"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/cost-comparison {"name":"acf/cost-comparison","data":{"eyebrow":"","_eyebrow":"field_cost_comparison_block_eyebrow","headline":"Where your money goes","_headline":"field_cost_comparison_block_headline","description":"For every dollar spent on your remote hiring setup, ask yourself: how much is actually going to the person doing the work?","_description":"field_cost_comparison_block_description","table_1_title":"Wing Assistant","_table_1_title":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_title","table_1_theme":"competitor","_table_1_theme":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_theme","table_2_title":"Remote Leverage","_table_2_title":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_title","table_2_theme":"leverage","_table_2_theme":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_theme","cta_text":"LEARN MORE ABOUT COSTS","_cta_text":"field_cost_comparison_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_cost_comparison_block_cta_url","table_1_rows":3,"_table_1_rows":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows","table_1_rows_0_label":"Reaches the VA","_table_1_rows_0_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_0_value":"Often only 30% to 50% of your monthly\nsubscription payment","_table_1_rows_0_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_1_rows_1_label":"Goes to the agency / platform","_table_1_rows_1_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_1_value":"50% to 70% recurring monthly margin\npocketed by Wing","_table_1_rows_1_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_1_rows_2_label":"Funds management \u0026 oversight","_table_1_rows_2_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_label","table_1_rows_2_value":"Bundled into high monthly fees (whether you\nuse it or not)","_table_1_rows_2_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows":3,"_table_2_rows":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows","table_2_rows_0_label":"Reaches the VA","_table_2_rows_0_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_0_value":"100% of agreed hourly wage","_table_2_rows_0_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_2_rows_1_label":"Goes to the agency / platform","_table_2_rows_1_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_1_value":"$0 monthly markup (we only charge\na transparent, one-time flat fee)","_table_2_rows_1_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value","table_2_rows_2_label":"Funds management \u0026 oversight","_table_2_rows_2_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_2_value":"Not bundled; you manage directly\nto build authentic company\nculture","_table_2_rows_2_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"money-goes"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/split-compare-cards {"name":"acf/split-compare-cards","data":{"headline":"Which is more affordable, Remote Leverage or Wing Assistant?","_headline":"field_split_compare_cards_block_headline","card_1_image":549,"_card_1_image":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_image","card_1_title":"Remote Leverage","_card_1_title":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_title","card_1_body":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you pay a managed service provider, a significant portion of your capital goes toward supporting the agency’s overhead. When you hire through Remote Leverage, your capital works harder.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy paying your talent a competitive local rate of \u003cstrong\u003e$6 to $10/hour\u003c/strong\u003e directly, you unlock \u003cstrong\u003e70% lower costs\u003c/strong\u003e compared to local hiring without sacrificing quality. This means you can easily reinvest the savings back into growth, product development, or additional roles.\u003c/p\u003e","_card_1_body":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_body","card_2_image":554,"_card_2_image":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_image","card_2_title":"Wing Assistant","_card_2_title":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_title","card_2_body":"\u003cp\u003eWing Assistant operates with a managed service model, providing global talent to businesses through a subscription. The subscription model means that only a percentage of what you’re billed actually reaches the virtual assistant.\u003cbr\u003eThis model is convenient for some businesses. But because virtual assistants receive lower compensation, subscription-based services often attract less experienced or qualified talent.\u003c/p\u003e","_card_2_body":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_body"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"more-affordable"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/process-step-cards {"name":"acf/process-step-cards","data":{"headline":"How Remote Leverage Works","_headline":"field_process_step_cards_block_headline","subheadline":"You interview and select your favorite. Hire your perfect match only after interviewing candidates yourself.","_subheadline":"field_process_step_cards_block_subheadline","steps":4,"_steps":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps","steps_0_number":"01","_steps_0_number":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_number","steps_0_title":"You tell us what you need","_steps_0_title":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_title","steps_0_text":"Schedule a consultation to map out the role, required skills, and cultural fit.","_steps_0_text":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_text","steps_0_image":559,"_steps_0_image":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_image","steps_1_number":"02","_steps_1_number":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_number","steps_1_title":"We screen hundreds of applicants","_steps_1_title":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_title","steps_1_text":"We present a vetted shortlist of 4 to 6 candidates within 48 hours.","_steps_1_text":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_text","steps_1_image":281,"_steps_1_image":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_image","steps_2_number":"03","_steps_2_number":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_number","steps_2_title":"You Interview \u0026 Hire","_steps_2_title":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_title","steps_2_text":"You speak directly with the candidates and choose your perfect match.","_steps_2_text":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_text","steps_2_image":282,"_steps_2_image":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_image","steps_3_number":"04","_steps_3_number":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_number","steps_3_title":"You employ the VA directly.","_steps_3_title":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_title","steps_3_text":"You employ your talent directly. We make international contracts, payroll, and local compliance completely seamless.","_steps_3_text":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_text","steps_3_image":556,"_steps_3_image":"field_process_step_cards_block_steps_image"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"how-rl-works"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/assurance-pair {"name":"acf/assurance-pair","align":"full","mode":"preview","data":{"item_1_title":"We charge a one-time flat\u003cbr\u003eplacement fee, billed after you hire.","_item_1_title":"field_assurance_pair_block_item_1_title","item_1_text":"A deposit is required to start the search that’s deducted from the final fee or refunded if you don’t hire. If your VA doesn’t work out within twelve months, we replace them at no additional cost.","_item_1_text":"field_assurance_pair_block_item_1_text","item_1_cta_text":"LEARN MORE ABOUT COSTS","_item_1_cta_text":"field_assurance_pair_block_item_1_cta_text","item_1_cta_url":"#booking-footer","_item_1_cta_url":"field_assurance_pair_block_item_1_cta_url","item_2_title":"The employment relationship\u003cbr\u003eis direct","_item_2_title":"field_assurance_pair_block_item_2_title","item_2_text":"