n":291,"_cards_4_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_4_title":"Tech\u003cbr\u003e\u0026 SaaS","_cards_4_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_4_text":"Scale faster and manage VAs ready to start in hours, not weeks.","_cards_4_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_5_icon":293,"_cards_5_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_5_title":"Legal","_cards_5_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_5_text":"Compliantly manage VAs to handle intake, document prep, and case admin.","_cards_5_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"rl-roles"}} /--><!-- wp:pattern {"slug":"remote-leverage/hire-va-4-testimonials","metadata":{"name":"client-reviews"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/image-card-grid {"name":"acf/image-card-grid","data":{"headline":"How Wing Assistant works","_headline":"field_image_card_grid_block_headline","subheadline":"","_subheadline":"field_image_card_grid_block_subheadline","columns":3,"_columns":"field_image_card_grid_block_columns","card_title_size":"large","_card_title_size":"field_image_card_grid_block_card_title_size","cards":3,"_cards":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards","cards_0_image":308,"_cards_0_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_0_eyebrow":"","_cards_0_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_0_title":"Subscription-Based\u003cbr\u003eTiered Pricing","_cards_0_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"Wing utilizes flat-rate, recurring monthly subscriptions (offering Part-Time and Full-Time tiers). Clients pay a fixed monthly fee that covers a set number of hours or dedicated access, bundling agency margins directly into the subscription.","_cards_0_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_1_image":303,"_cards_1_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_1_eyebrow":"","_cards_1_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_1_title":"Managed Onboarding \u0026amp;\u003cbr\u003eSuccess Oversight","_cards_1_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Upon signing up, Wing pairs clients with an Account Executive and an assigned Dedicated Customer Success Manager (CSM). The CSM acts as an intermediary to supervise assistant onboarding, track task execution, and step in if performance issues arise.","_cards_1_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_2_image":304,"_cards_2_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_2_eyebrow":"","_cards_2_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_2_title":"Target buyer profile","_cards_2_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Wing serves best as a solution for busy executives and early-stage entrepreneurs who prefer a hands-off administrative setup. It appeals to buyers seeking quick, general task-runner delegation through a centralized mobile/web app without managing human resources directly.","_cards_2_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"how-competitor-works"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/roles-carousel {"name":"acf/roles-carousel","data":{"headline":"10 Roles and Industries\u003cbr\u003eWing Supports","_headline":"field_roles_carousel_block_headline","cards":6,"_cards":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards","cards_0_icon":287,"_cards_0_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_0_title":"Executive \u0026\u003cbr\u003eGeneral Admin","_cards_0_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"Manage VAs who filter inboxes, organize calendars, coordinate travel, and handle routine administrative tasks.","_cards_0_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_1_icon":289,"_cards_1_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_1_title":"Medical \u0026\u003cbr\u003eHealthcare","_cards_1_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Assign VAs to handle patient appointment setting, insurance verification, and intake admin.","_cards_1_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_2_icon":290,"_cards_2_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_2_title":"Real Estate\u003cbr\u003eSupport","_cards_2_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Utilize VAs for cold outreach, property listing updates, transaction coordination, and CRM management.","_cards_2_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_3_icon":285,"_cards_3_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_3_title":"E-commerce\u003cbr\u003e\u0026 Retail","_cards_3_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_3_text":"Utilize VAs for basic customer service ticketing, order tracking inquiries, and catalog data entry.","_cards_3_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_4_icon":291,"_cards_4_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_4_title":"Sales \u0026\u003cbr\u003eLead Gen","_cards_4_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_4_text":"Deploy assistants to perform cold email outreach, prospect list building, and preliminary lead qualification.","_cards_4_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text","cards_5_icon":310,"_cards_5_icon":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_icon","cards_5_title":"Social Media \u0026\u003cbr\u003eContent","_cards_5_title":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_title","cards_5_text":"Manage VAs who build content calendars, schedule posts across platforms, and handle basic graphics using tools like Canva.","_cards_5_text":"field_roles_carousel_block_cards_text"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"competitor-roles"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/talent-carousel {"name":"acf/talent-carousel","data":{"headline":"Finding the right talent to help you scale","_headline":"field_talent_carousel_block_headline","body":"\u003cp\u003eScaling a business requires independent problem-solvers, not just task-receivers. While traditional managed services match you with general \u0022virtual assistants\u0022 who handle basic, repetitive tasks, Remote Leverage focuses on sourcing \u003cstrong\u003especialized professionals\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you need a full-time cold caller to scale your outreach, an executive assistant to manage high-level operations, or a technical support agent to assist developers, we build a custom sourcing pipeline designed around your business goals. By hiring directly, you attract higher-quality talent who see your business as a long-term career path rather than a temporary agency assignment.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_talent_carousel_block_body","cta_text":"Book a consultation","_cta_text":"field_talent_carousel_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_talent_carousel_block_cta_url","profiles":3,"_profiles":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles","profiles_0_image":279,"_profiles_0_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_0_name":"María Fernanda","_profiles_0_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_0_role":"Administrative Assistant","_profiles_0_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_0_rate":"$8 Per Hour","_profiles_0_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate","profiles_1_image":280,"_profiles_1_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_1_name":"Luciana Lopez","_profiles_1_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_1_role":"Administrative Assistant","_profiles_1_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_1_rate":"$10 Per Hour","_profiles_1_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate","profiles_2_image":214,"_profiles_2_image":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_image","profiles_2_name":"Catalina García","_profiles_2_name":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_name","profiles_2_role":"Administrative Assistant","_profiles_2_role":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_role","profiles_2_rate":"$12 Per Hour","_profiles_2_rate":"field_talent_carousel_block_profiles_rate"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"talent-carousel"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/media-copy {"name":"acf/media-copy","align":"full","mode":"preview","data":{"headline":"Talent pool, time zones, and language standards","_headline":"field_media_copy_block_headline","body":"\u003cp\u003eWhere your talent lives determines how they work with you, how fast they respond, and how well they align with your clients, customers, and culture.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTalent pool:\u003c/strong\u003e Remote Leverage receives 2,000+ applications daily, and only the top 1% of talent from LATAM and Caribbean across 50+ roles enter the Remote Leverage talent pool.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTime zone alignment:\u003c/strong\u003e Remote Leverage’s LATAM talent works US Eastern, Central, Mountain, and Pacific hours natively — managed services that source primarily from Southeast Asia either ask talent to work overnight, which affects retention, or accept asynchronous coverage that slows your team down.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLanguage standards:\u003c/strong\u003e With Remote Leverage, English fluency is verified before a candidate reaches your shortlist through multi-step verbal, written, and comprehension assessments. We evaluate clarity on live calls, not just written samples, because most roles require real conversations with your clients and your team.\u003c/p\u003e","_body":"field_media_copy_block_body","image":309,"_image":"field_media_copy_block_image","image_position":"left","_image_position":"field_media_copy_block_image_position","cta_text":"Book a consultation","_cta_text":"field_media_copy_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_media_copy_block_cta_url"},"metadata":{"name":"talent-pool"}} /--><!-- wp:group {"align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"5rem","bottom":"6rem"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained","contentSize":"1380px"},"metadata":{"name":"screening"}} -->
