idance, and a managed workflow without the responsibility of hiring or managing a remote team member directly. Ideal for a hands-off support model with minimal oversight and control.","_table_1_rows_6_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_1_rows_value","table_2_rows_6_label":"Best for","_table_2_rows_6_label":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_label","table_2_rows_6_value":"Founders, operators, and scaling teams looking for high-tier talent, long-term loyalty, and 70% cost savings.","_table_2_rows_6_value":"field_cost_comparison_block_table_2_rows_value"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"full-comparison"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/image-card-grid {"name":"acf/image-card-grid","data":{"headline":"Already using Wing Assistant and want to switch?","_headline":"field_image_card_grid_block_headline","subheadline":"If you’ve decided to switch from Wing Assistant to a direct hire, the transition is straightforward. The cleanest path takes about four weeks. Here is the recommended sequence to prevent operational disruptions:","_subheadline":"field_image_card_grid_block_subheadline","columns":3,"_columns":"field_image_card_grid_block_columns","card_title_size":"large","_card_title_size":"field_image_card_grid_block_card_title_size","cards":3,"_cards":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards","cards_0_image":308,"_cards_0_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_0_eyebrow":"01","_cards_0_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_0_title":"Launch a Custom Search with Remote Leverage:","_cards_0_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_0_text":"We’ll source, screen, and present your 4 to 6 vetted candidates in 48 hours.","_cards_0_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_1_image":303,"_cards_1_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_1_eyebrow":"02","_cards_1_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_1_title":"Interview, Select, and Onboard:","_cards_1_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_1_text":"Choose your ideal candidate and onboard them. Use our integrated onboarding and contractor platform to set up their direct payroll and local compliance instantly.","_cards_1_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cards_2_image":304,"_cards_2_image":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_image","cards_2_eyebrow":"03","_cards_2_eyebrow":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_eyebrow","cards_2_title":"Transition and Terminate your Wing Assistant Subscription:","_cards_2_title":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_title","cards_2_text":"Have your new direct hire shadow your operations for a brief handover window, then safely cancel your Wing subscription.","_cards_2_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cards_text","cta_text":"BOOK A CONSULTATION","_cta_text":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_text","cta_url":"#booking-footer","_cta_url":"field_image_card_grid_block_cta_url"},"align":"full","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"switch"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/split-compare-cards {"name":"acf/split-compare-cards","align":"full","mode":"preview","data":{"headline":"Who is Remote Leverage Best For vs Who is Wing Assistant Best for","_headline":"field_split_compare_cards_block_headline","card_1_image":301,"_card_1_image":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_image","card_1_title":"Remote Leverage","_card_1_title":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_title","card_1_body":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Execution Roles:\u003c/strong\u003e Scaling teams that need specialized talent (Sales, Growth Marketing, Operations, and Finance) rather than just simple “virtual assistants.”\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCost-Conscious Builders:\u003c/strong\u003e Operators who want to pay the direct raw wage ($6–$10/hr) to talent without throwing away $500–$1,000+ every month in permanent middleman fees.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIn-House Company Culture:\u003c/strong\u003e Founders who want their talent to feel like true internal team members, fully integrated into internal systems and mission.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","_card_1_body":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_1_body","card_2_image":300,"_card_2_image":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_image","card_2_title":"Wing Assistant","_card_2_title":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_title","card_2_body":"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicro-Task Delegators:\u003c/strong\u003e Businesses that only need a few hours of basic data entry a week and don’t want to manage anyone.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAgency-Managed QA:\u003c/strong\u003e Companies that prefer to pay a premium to have a third-party manager handle simple daily check-ins.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","_card_2_body":"field_split_compare_cards_block_card_2_body"},"metadata":{"name":"best-for"}} /--><!-- wp:acf/accordion-faq {"name":"acf/accordion-faq","data":{"headline":"Frequently Asked Questions","_headline":"field_accordion_faq_block_headline","faqs":8,"_faqs":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs","faqs_0_question":"What is the difference between Remote Leverage and a managed service like Wing Assistant?","_faqs_0_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_0_answer":"\u003cp\u003eManaged services charge an ongoing monthly or hourly fee to “rent” virtual assistants to you. Remote Leverage is a premium recruiting agency. We run an active headhunting search to find your perfect match, charge a transparent one-time placement fee, and assist you in hiring them directly. This saves you up to 70% on long-term overhead costs.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_0_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_1_question":"Can I transition my existing team members from Wing Assistant to Remote Leverage?","_faqs_1_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_1_answer":"\u003cp\u003eYes! If you want to stop paying high monthly platform markups for your current setup, we can help you transition to a direct-hire model, utilizing our contractor compliance and payment platform to manage them cleanly.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_1_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_2_question":"How do taxes \u0026 payroll work when hiring Virtual Assistants?","_faqs_2_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_2_answer":"\u003cp\u003eRemote Leverage can handle all payments and compliance requirements for your Virtual Assistant. This means you can focus on growing your business while they handle tax compliance, payroll processing, legal requirements, and international payment regulations.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_2_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_3_question":"What's the difference between Staffing and Recruiting Agencies?","_faqs_3_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_3_answer":"\u003cp\u003eStaffing agencies charge monthly fees but only pay a small portion to Virtual Assistants. This often results in lower quality talent, as skilled VAs avoid arrangements where agencies keep a large chunk of their earnings. At Remote Leverage, we charge just one flat fee after you hire. Your Virtual Assistant receives 100% of what you pay them directly.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_3_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_4_question":"What happens if the candidate does not work out?","_faqs_4_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_4_answer":"\u003cp\u003eRemote Leverage offers an industry-leading 12-Month Free Replacement Guarantee. If your hired professional is not a perfect fit at any point during their first year, we will source a new candidate slate and replace them at absolutely no extra charge.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_4_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_5_question":"How is their English and Communication skills?","_faqs_5_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_5_answer":"\u003cp\u003eWe maintain extremely high standards for English fluency. All candidates must submit an English voice recording, and we only select those with fluent English and minimal accents. Only the best communicators make it through our screening.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_5_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_6_question":"Can I start with Part-time?","_faqs_6_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_6_answer":"\u003cp\u003eYes, you can start with either part-time or full-time. The minimum is 20 hours per week, as our most qualified Virtual Assistants prefer stable positions with consistent hours.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_6_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer","faqs_7_question":"How much does the average Virtual Assistant cost?","_faqs_7_question":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_question","faqs_7_answer":"\u003cp\u003eVirtual Assistant hourly rates depend on the skills and experience they have, and also the region you're hiring from. Entry Level: $6-$10 per hour. Highly Experienced: $11-$15 per hour. The hourly rate you agree to pay goes directly to your Virtual Assistant.\u003c/p\u003e","_faqs_7_answer":"field_accordion_faq_block_faqs_answer"},"align":"","mode":"preview","metadata":{"name":"faq"}} /--><!-- wp:pattern {"slug":"remote-leverage/hire-va-4-booking-footer","metadata":{"name":"booking-footer"}} /-->
